sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Procd as OpenWrt procd
    participant HID as S81 USB HID
    participant APP as S83 appd
    participant CTL as S84 controld
    participant Play as S25 boot-play
    participant Data as S95 数据持久化
    participant BT as S97 蓝牙初始化
    participant KVM as S98 IPKVM
    participant Back as S99 lv_backend
    participant UI as aitvbox-start-ui / lvglsim

    Procd->>Play: 启动开机画面，boot_progress=5
    Procd->>HID: 配置 USB gadget
    HID->>HID: 建立 hidg0 键盘 + hidg1 相对鼠标
    Procd->>APP: 启动 aitvbox-appd
    APP->>APP: 发布 /var/run/aitvbox/apps.sock
    Procd->>CTL: 启动 aitvbox-controld
    CTL->>CTL: 发布 /var/run/aitvbox/control.sock
    Procd->>Data: bind overlay 持久化数据
    Note over Data: Wi-Fi、蓝牙、Tuya KV、100ask 身份/配置
    Procd->>BT: 初始化 AIC 蓝牙控制器
    Procd->>KVM: 启动 aitvbox-ipkvmd 与 KVM video worker
    KVM->>KVM: 发布 Web、WebRTC、视频/控制 Socket
    Procd->>Back: 启动 lv_backend，boot_progress=78
    Back->>Back: app_config_init + sys_settings_init
    Back->>Back: mw_init(true)，先发布 IPC
    Back->>Back: backend_command_router_register
    Back->>Back: backend_runtime_start
    Note over Back: LED → time → Wi-Fi → video → sensor → BT<br/>→ AI → HDMI preview → OTA → cloud
    Procd->>UI: 启动 aitvbox-start-ui，boot_progress=84
    UI->>Back: 等待 /tmp/lv_port_linux_backend.sock
    Back-->>UI: IPC 可连接
    UI->>Play: boot_progress=100，结束启动画面
    UI->>UI: exec lvglsim → lv_init → mw_init(false) → ui_init
    UI->>Back: 心跳 + UI 命令
    Back-->>UI: 服务状态与事件
